From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tom Ramsden <tomjramsden@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 20:33:52 +0000
Subject: audren-refill: the audio renderer refills a short output queue at a
 2.5 ms gap, so a hiccup no longer leaves it one block ahead of the sound card
 for good (Ocarina of Time's crunching behind the music)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
